与本地仓库工具。将插件安装包保存在本地，按需选择版本下载、备份和重新安装。\n\n## 主要功能\n\n- **仅下载不安装**：选择软件源中可用的版本，支持连同依赖下载。\n- **本地仓库**：集中管理 DEB，查看版本与下载来源，支持导出及交给 Sileo 安装。\n- **自动备份**：升级前保存旧版本，也可开启安装时备份，覆盖首次安装、升级和重装。\n- **已购插件下载**：使用 Sileo 当前商店账户验证购买状态，获取授权后下载入仓。\n- **来源与校验**：醒目标记其他源版本；索引提供 SHA256 时校验下载文件。\n- **仓库管理**：设置版本保留数量，标记当前源中已不可用的版本。\n\n## 使用方式\n\n1. 安装后重新打开 **Sileo**。\n2. 在软件包页点击顶部的 **Doleo**，进入仓库。\n3. 在插件详情页点击安装按钮旁的图标，选择下载或查看仓库。\n\n自动备份需在设置中手动开启。\n\n下载已购插件前，请先在 Sileo 登录对应软件源账户，并打开该插件详情页。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true}]},{"tabname":"更新日志","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://doleo.goforit.si/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/doleo","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdev","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"加入 TG 频道","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://t.me/junhongdevchat","openExternal":true,"tintColor":